#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:5
#: 8ce33fed86894cdc9d0d95b725959eb6
msgid "Tuning Process Instructions"
msgstr "调参流程说明"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:7
#: c6c9ca05888e43aabcda722b82a81259
msgid "The tuning process consists of the following steps:"
msgstr "调参流程包括以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:9
#: 538f467657ce4e059036529ca5357e59
msgid ""
":ref:`Setting up the parameters to prepare for the first tuning "
"flights<setting-up-for-tuning>`"
msgstr ":ref:`设置参数以准备首次调参飞行<setting-up-for-tuning>`"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:10
#: 15dbf810cc1d440bb2a7581ebb39a9c6
msgid ""
":ref:`Initial tuning flight <initial-tuning-flight>` to obtain a stable, but"
" not necessarily optimized, tune."
msgstr ":ref:`初始调参飞行 <initial-tuning-flight>`，以获得稳定但不一定优化的调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:11
#: eabf6d9958a14b91b52aa10aa141ce1c
msgid ""
":ref:`Evaluation of the initial stable tuning <evaluating-the-aircraft-"
"tune>`"
msgstr ":ref:`评估初始稳定调参结果 <evaluating-the-aircraft-tune>`"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:12
#: 3c5f85a6bc914d7bbe1269b61c6b8400
msgid "Setup Noise notch filters, see :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering`"
msgstr "设置噪声陷波滤波器，参见 :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering`"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:13
#: a3a3dff670f743a08798f92eaec5a467
msgid ""
":ref:`Manual tuning of Roll and Pitch<ac_rollpitchtuning>` and/or use "
":ref:`quiktune` scripting (required before attempting to use AUTOTUNE!)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`手动调参横滚和俯仰<ac_rollpitchtuning>` 和/或使用 :ref:`quiktune` 脚本（在尝试使用 AUTOTUNE"
" 之前必须完成！）"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:14
#: 851e14d0c6814bd089da79439e18badb
msgid ":ref:`AUTOTUNE<autotune>`."
msgstr ":ref:`AUTOTUNE<autotune>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:15
#: 8b22ddf991b94ff5b9e6d3dfeb4f0d23
msgid ""
"Setting the :ref:`Input Shaping<input-shaping>` parameters to obtain the "
"desired \"feel\""
msgstr "设置 :ref:`输入整形<input-shaping>` 参数以获得所需的\"手感\""

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:18
#: 1c552f146ffb44b281e770bf98475879
msgid ""
"The initial tune of the aircraft should be done **in the aircraft's most "
"agile configuration**. This generally means that the aircraft will be at its"
" minimum take off weight with fully charged batteries."
msgstr "飞行器的初始调参应在 **飞行器最灵活的配置下** 进行。这通常意味着飞行器将以最小起飞重量、满电电池的状态进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-process-instructions.rst:20
#: a802cfbeec424a9aaa8d53eb9ec8d7e7
msgid ""
"Following each of the above steps will usually result in a safe tuning "
"process and adequate tune for most users. Alternatively consider using the "
"`Methodic Configurator "
"<https://ardupilot.github.io/MethodicConfigurator/>`__ for step-by-step "
"setup"
msgstr ""
"按照上述每个步骤操作通常会产生安全的调参过程，对大多数用户来说也是足够的调参结果。或者考虑使用 `Methodic Configurator "
"<https://ardupilot.github.io/MethodicConfigurator/>`__ 进行逐步设置"

